@startuml UC-10: Pengaturan Akun (Account Settings)

title UC-10: Pengaturan Akun (Account Settings)\nSistem Smart Aquaponic

skinparam sequenceMessageAlign center
skinparam responseMessageBelowArrow true
skinparam maxMessageSize 230
skinparam sequence {
    ArrowColor #2C7BE5
    ActorBorderColor #2C7BE5
    LifeLineBorderColor #2C7BE5
    ParticipantBorderColor #2C7BE5
    ParticipantBackgroundColor #EBF4FF
    ActorBackgroundColor #EBF4FF
    GroupBackgroundColor #F0F4FF
    GroupBorderColor #ADC8FF
}

actor       "User / Admin"                  as User
boundary    "AccountSettingsPage (UI)"      as UI
control     "AccountController"            as AC
entity      "Users <<database>>"           as DB
entity      "Session <<database>>"         as Session

== UC-10a: Lihat Halaman Pengaturan Akun ==

User  ->  UI  : GET /account
activate UI
UI    ->  AC  : index()
activate AC
AC    ->  AC  : Auth::user() — ambil user yang sedang login
AC   -->  UI  : view('account_settings.index', user)
deactivate AC
UI   -->  User : Tampilkan form profil (nama, email, telepon)\nbeserta opsi ganti password
deactivate UI

== UC-10b: Update Profil & Password ==

User  ->  UI  : Edit data → Submit (PUT /account/update)
activate UI
UI    ->  AC  : PUT /account/update\n{name, email, phone_number, ?password, ?password_confirmation}
activate AC

AC    ->  AC  : Auth::user() — ambil user yang login

' Validasi input
AC    ->  AC  : validate({\nname: required|string|max:255,\nemail: required|email|unique:users,email,{user.id},\nphone_number: nullable|string|max:20,\npassword: nullable|min:8|confirmed\n})

alt Validasi Gagal
    AC   -->  UI  : redirect back()->withErrors()->withInput()
    UI   -->  User : Tampilkan pesan error (email sudah dipakai, password tidak cocok, dll.)
else Validasi Berhasil
    AC    ->  AC  : user->name = validated.name\nuser->email = validated.email\nuser->phone_number = validated.phone_number

    alt Password Diisi (request->filled('password'))
        AC    ->  AC  : user->password = Hash::make(validated.password)\n(enkripsi bcrypt)
        note right : Password lama tidak diperlukan\n(tidak ada verifikasi password lama)
    else Password Tidak Diisi
        note over AC : Password lama tetap dipertahankan
    end

    AC    ->  DB  : user->save()
    activate DB
    DB   -->  AC  : Data user tersimpan
    deactivate DB

    AC   -->  UI  : redirect()->back()->with('success', 'Akun berhasil diperbarui!')
    UI   -->  User : Flash sukses, form menampilkan data terbaru
end

deactivate AC
deactivate UI

== UC-10c: Hapus Akun ==

User  ->  UI  : Klik "Hapus Akun" → Konfirmasi
activate UI
UI    ->  AC  : DELETE /account/destroy
activate AC

AC    ->  AC  : Auth::user() — ambil user yang akan dihapus

AC    ->  AC  : Auth::logout()\nHapus autentikasi dari session
AC    ->  DB  : user->delete() (hapus record user)
activate DB
DB   -->  AC  : User dihapus permanen
deactivate DB

AC    ->  Session : session()->invalidate()\nsession()->regenerateToken()
activate Session
Session -->  AC   : Session lama tidak valid
deactivate Session

AC   -->  UI  : redirect('/')\n->with('success', 'Akun berhasil dihapus')
deactivate AC
UI   -->  User : Arahkan ke halaman utama (redirect ke /login)
deactivate UI

@enduml
